  "question": {
    "text": "Let the line <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi></math> and the ellipse <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> intersect at a point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> in the first quadrant. If the normal to this ellipse at <math><mi>P</mi></math> meets the co-ordinate axes at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math><p>Equation of normal at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>It passes through</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8201;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math> (as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> lies in Ist quadrant)</p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
}